  "updated_at": "2026-04-13",
  "bio": "Scott Bramble is a highly skilled tattoo artist, renowned for his exquisite black and gray tattoos. With over three decades of experience, he has been crafting exceptional body art since 1990 and has been the proud owner of Mercury Tattoo Studio in Doylestown, United States, since 2000. Scott's dedication to his craft is evident in every meticulous stroke and shade, making him a sought-after artist for those seeking top-tier black and gray inkwork.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Doylestown, Pennsylvania, United States\n\nTattooer since 90\nMercury Tattoo since 00\nWhenever I’m not at work I try to get out in the woods with Holly (my love) and Hank (my Brussels Griffon)",
